{"type":"tool_execution_end","toolCallId":"call_00_46vld2lb0qyz6xg2j0rfcp67","toolName":"mcp","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Found 8 tools matching \"customer\":\n\ndocument-intelligence_get_customer\n  One customer with contacts, recent documents and outstanding balance. ref = customer code (C-0001) or id.\n\n  Shape:\n    { ref: string; }\n\ndocument-intelligence_match_customer\n  Check whether a person/company already exists before saving. Returns verdict existing | possible | new with scored candidates and reasons. Always call before save_name_card or creating a customer.\n\n  Shape:\n    { company_name?: string; person_name?: string; reg_no?: string; tin?: string; email?: string; phone?: string; mobile?: string; }\n\ndocument-intelligence_save_customer\n  Create a customer (refuses likely duplicates unless allow_duplicate) or update one by id (only the fields you pass change).\n\n  Parameters:\n    id (string)\n    allow_duplicate (boolean)\n    kind (enum: \"company\", \"individual\")\n    name (string) - Trading / display name\n    legal_name (string)\n    reg_no (string) - SSM / business registration no.\n    id_type (enum: \"BRN\", \"NRIC\", \"PASSPORT\", \"ARMY\")\n    tin (string) - LHDN tax identification no.\n    sst_no (string)\n    industry (string)\n    email (string)\n    phone (string)\n    website (string)\n    billing_address - Address: {line1, line2, postcode, city, state, country} (preferred) or a multi-line string\n      anyOf:\n        - string\n        - object\n          line1 (string)\n          line2 (string)\n          line3 (string)\n          postcode (string)\n          city (string)\n          state (string)\n          country (string)\n    shipping_address - Address: {line1, line2, postcode, city, state, country} (preferred) or a multi-line string\n      anyOf:\n        - string\n        - object\n          line1 (string)\n          line2 (string)\n          line3 (string)\n          postcode (string)\n          city (s