 a document (draft or issued) to PDF in your workspace. Drafts carry a DRAFT banner.\n\n  Shape:\n    { document: string; template_id?: string; }\n\ndocument-intelligence_get_customer\n  One customer with contacts, recent documents and outstanding balance. ref = customer code (C-0001) or id.\n\n  Shape:\n    { ref: string; }\n\ndocument-intelligence_update_draft\n  Edit a draft: header fields via set, and add/update/remove lines. Refuses issued documents.\n\n  Parameters:\n    document (string) *required* - Document id (drafts have no number)\n    set (object)\n      customer (string)\n      contact_id (string)\n      issue_date (string)\n      valid_until (string)\n      due_date (string)\n      reference (string)\n      notes (string)\n      terms (string)\n      template_id (string)\n      custom (object) - Custom field values (keys must be defined by the DB Manager)\n    add_lines (array)\n      items (object)\n        product (string) - Product SKU or id\n        package (string) - Package code or id\n        description (string) - Line text; required for a one-off line with no product/package\n        quantity (number)\n        unit (string)\n        unit_price (number) - Overrides the catalogue price\n        discount_amount (number) - Discount in currency for the whole line\n        tax_code (string) - e.g. SV8, ST10, NT\n    update_lines (array)\n      items (object)\n        line_id (string) *required*\n        description (string)\n        quantity (number)\n        unit (string)\n        unit_price (number)\n        discount_amount (number)\n        tax_code (string)\n    remove_line_ids (array)\n      items (string)\n\ndocument-intelligence_cancel_draft\n  Cancel (archive) a draft that won't be issued.\n\n  Shape:\n    { document: string; }\n\ndocument-intelligence_convert_to_invoice\n  Turn an issued/accepted quotation into an invoice DRAFT with the same lines and prices; marks the quotation converted.\n\n  Shape:\n    { quotation: string; due_date?: string; }\n\ndocument-intelligence_create_draft\n  Create a draft quotation/invoice (no number yet, freely editable). Returns the draft and its readiness to issue.\n\n  Parameters:\n    doc_type (enum: \"quotation\", \"invoice\", \"credit_note\") *required*\n    customer (string) *required* - Customer code or id\n    contact_id (string)\n    lines (array) *required*\n      items (object)\n        product (string) - Product SKU or id\n        package (string) - Package code or id\n        description (string) - Line text; required for a one-off line with no product/package\n        quantity (number)\n        unit (string)\n        unit_price (number) - Overrides the catalogue price\n        discount_amount (number) - Discount in currency for the whole line\n        tax_code (string) - e.g. SV8, ST10, NT\n    issue_date (string)\n    valid_until (string) - Quotations: YYYY-MM-DD\n    due_date (string) - Invoices: YYYY-MM-DD\n    reference (string) - Customer PO / project reference\n    notes (string)\n    terms (string)\n    template_id (string)\n    custom (object) - Custom field values (keys must be defined by the DB Manager)\n\ndocument-intelligence_describe_schema\n  What each record type means, its standard and custom fields, readiness rules and numbering. Read this before assuming a field exists.\n\n  Shape:\n    { entity?: string; }\n\ndocument-intelligence_find_catalog\n  Search products and packages (words are ANDed). Returns prices and tax codes.\n\n  Shape:\n    { query?: string; limit?: number; }\n\ndocument-intelligence_find_customers\n  Search customers by name, code, email, reg no, or contact name. Empty query lists the latest.\n\n  Shape:\n    { query?: string; limit?: number; }\n\ndocument-intelligence_get_package\n  A package with its items and effective price.\n\n  Shape:\n    { ref: string; }\n\ndocument-intelligence_list_tax_codes\n  Tax codes (Malaysian SST) and which is the default.\n\n  Shape:\n    {}\n\ndocument-intelligence_match_customer\n  Check whether a person/company already exists before saving. Returns verdict existing | possible | new with scored candidates and reasons. Always call before save_name_card or creating a customer.\n\n  Shape:\n    { company_name?: string; person_name?: string; reg_no?: string; tin?: string; email?: string; phone?: string; mobile?: string; }\n\ndocument-intelligence_record_payment\n  Record money received and allocate it to one or more invoices (partial payments allowed). Updates invoice status.\n\n  Shape:\n    { customer?: string; amount: number; received_on?: string; method?: \"bank_transfer\" | \"cash\" | \"cheque\" | \"card\" | \"ewallet\" | \"other\"; reference?: string; notes?: string; allocations?: { invoice: string; amount: number; }[]; }\n\ndocument-intelligence_set_quotation_status\n  Mark an issued quotation accepted, rejected or expired.\n\n  Shape:\n    { document: string; status: \"accepted\" | \"rejected\" | \"expired\"; }"}],"details":{"mode":"search","matches":[{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_get_document","score":443},{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_void_document","score":443},{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_list_documents","score":413},{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_issue_document","score":393},{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_prepare_document","score":393},{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_get_company_profile","score":343},{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_list_templates","score":343},{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_render_pdf","score":343},{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_get_customer","score":333},{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_update_draft","score":333},{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_cancel_draft","sco